    "chunk_text": "De somniorum diuersiitate secundum ordinem abcharii Danielis prophete be swefena mistlicnesse \u00e6fter Aues in somnis qui uiderit & cum ipsis pugnauerit, lites aliquas significat fugelas on swefenum se\u00fee Aues in somnis capere, lucrum significat fugelas on swefnum gefon gestreon hit getacna\u00f0. Aues aliquid a se rapuisse, damnum significat fugelas sum\u00feincg fram him gegripan hearm hit getacna\u00f0. Asinos uel edos uiderit, crimen negotii significat assan o\u00f0\u00f0e hecenu gesih\u00f0 gylt ceapes hit getacna\u00f0. Arma in somnis portare, tutamentum significat w\u00e6pnu on sw\u00e6fnum beran bewerunge hit getacna\u00f0. Asinos edere, laborem significat assan etan geswinc hit getacna\u00f0. Asinos clamantes aut solutos currere, aliquam litem aduersari\u00eb significat assan clipiende o\u00f0\u00f0e untiede Aues bullientes uiderit, inimicorum malam locutionem significat fugeles sceottende gesih\u00f0 feonda yfele Arbores cum fructu uiderit, lucrum exsperatum significat treow mid w\u00e6stme gesih\u00f0 gestreon gewilnode Arbores ascendere, aliquam dignitatem optinebit treow uppastigan sumne wyr\u00f0scype he begyt. Aerem limpidem uiderit, negotii expeditionem significat weder hlutter gesih\u00f0 ceapes fer\u00f0runge hit A bestiis qui si uiderit infestare, ab inimicis superabitur fram wyldeorum se\u00fee hine gesih\u00f0 ehtan fram Arcum tendere uel sagittas mittere, laborem uel anxietatem significat bogan bendan o\u00f0\u00f0e flan asendan Anullum in somnis uiderit, locum exsperatum significat ring on swefnum gesih\u00f0 st",
